      "role": "user",
      "content": "Wait, really? I thought the seismic data was mostly just \"conditional\" based on specific magnitudes. Let me see... looking at the section on soil stability, it mentions some issues with liquefaction during minor seismic events, but it seems pretty technical and localized. Are you saying that's a dealbreaker? Because if we kill this project over \"technicalities\" when the economy is this bad, my department is going to take a massive hit from the council.",
